                                                "sense_id": "d7595532-eb1b-33e5-9edb-c769493a7cec",
                                                "text": "Soon, 'midst the shriekings of the tossing wind, / The 'dark blue depths' he sang of, shall have bore / Our all of Byron to his native shore!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
