                                                "sense_id": "681db84a-d95d-339f-92b4-8af84d1bdd25",
                                                "text": "Then the old scourge of dusk swooped down upon the warderless hoard. It is he who burns up the sky at night in long trails of yellow flame, who flies above houses in a whirlwind of shrieking wings and gagging smoke."
